{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "id": "guitar",
  "name": "Guitar",
  "description": "Twelve synthesized guitar voices: chorus-doubled clean and overdriven electrics, 12-string shimmer, steel and nylon acoustics, round and picked basses, metallic resonator, natural harmonics, palm-muted chord stabs, slide-legato and a string-scrape FX. Plucked tones layer detuned saws and triangles with fast-decaying upper partials to imitate string decay, plus short noise transients for pick attack. Pure synthesis, no samples; melodic presets for the piano roll, not kits.",
